```java
public int minSteps(int n) {
    if (n == 1) return 0;
    for (int i = 2; i <= Math.sqrt(n); i++) {
        if (n % i == 0) return i + minSteps(n / i);
    }
    return n;
}
```

```java
public int minSteps(int n) {
    int[] dp = new int[n + 1];
    int h = (int) Math.sqrt(n);
    for (int i = 2; i <= n; i++) {
        dp[i] = i;
        for (int j = 2; j <= h; j++) {
            if (i % j == 0) {
                dp[i] = dp[j] + dp[i / j];
                break;
            }
        }
    }
    return dp[n];
}
```

167\. Two Sum II - Input array is sorted (Easy)

