409\. Longest Palindrome (Easy)

[Leetcode](https://leetcode.com/problems/longest-palindrome/description/) / [力扣](https://leetcode-cn.com/problems/longest-palindrome/description/)

```html
Input : "abccccdd"
Output : 7
