```java
public String addBinary(String a, String b) {
    int i = a.length() - 1, j = b.length() - 1, carry = 0;
    StringBuilder str = new StringBuilder();
    while (carry == 1 || i >= 0 || j >= 0) {
        if (i >= 0 && a.charAt(i--) == '1') {
            carry++;
        }
        if (j >= 0 && b.charAt(j--) == '1') {
            carry++;
        }
        str.append(carry % 2);
        carry /= 2;
    }
    return str.reverse().toString();
}
```

