二分查找解法：

```java
public int findDuplicate(int[] nums) {
     int l = 1, h = nums.length - 1;
     while (l <= h) {
         int mid = l + (h - l) / 2;
         int cnt = 0;
         for (int i = 0; i < nums.length; i++) {
             if (nums[i] <= mid) cnt++;
         }
         if (cnt > mid) h = mid - 1;
         else l = mid + 1;
     }
     return l;
}
```

双指针解法，类似于有环链表中找出环的入口：

```java
public int findDuplicate(int[] nums) {
    int slow = nums[0], fast = nums[nums[0]];
    while (slow != fast) {
        slow = nums[slow];
        fast = nums[nums[fast]];
    }
    fast = 0;
    while (slow != fast) {
        slow = nums[slow];
        fast = nums[fast];
    }
    return slow;
}
```

