## 解题思路

```java
private TreeNode pre = null;
private TreeNode head = null;

public TreeNode Convert(TreeNode root) {
    inOrder(root);
    return head;
}

private void inOrder(TreeNode node) {
    if (node == null)
        return;
    inOrder(node.left);
    node.left = pre;
    if (pre != null)
        pre.right = node;
    pre = node;
    if (head == null)
        head = node;
    inOrder(node.right);
}
```

